      "side": 1,
      "message": "Minor: In order to reduce code and logic on the C++ side, I would have a slight preference to reduce code here and assign to `info-\u003efType` directly and putting static asserts to match the enum values between `SkAdvancedTypefaceMetrics` and `ffi` so that we don\u0027t have to have conditional conversion here. What do you think?",
      "revId": "fdd1a05b277a37ea83ac467b5d42aa7e723e59d2",
